<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vezot_hatorah">
<tei:p>
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:deuteronomy/4/44"/>This is the Torah which Moses placed before the children of Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/vezot_hatorah/al_pi"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/9/23">It is in accordance with the Lord’s command through Moses.</tei:seg>
</tei:p><tei:p>
<tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/3/18"/>It is a tree of life to those who take hold of it, and happy are those who support it.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/3/17"/>Its ways are pleasant ways, and all its paths are peace.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/3/16"/>Long life is in its right hand, and in its left hand are riches and honor.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/42/21"/>The Lord was pleased, because of his righteousness, to render the Torah great and glorious.
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
</tei:p>
</tei:div>
